sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant API
    participant ConnApp as Connections
    participant Google as Google API
    participant DB

    User->>API: POST /connections/google/auth-url
    API->>ConnApp: GenerateAuthURL()
    ConnApp-->>User: consent URL

    User->>User: open URL, consent, copy code

    User->>API: POST /connections/google/callback
    API->>ConnApp: CompleteOAuth(userID, code)
    ConnApp->>Google: exchange code for tokens
    Google-->>ConnApp: access_token + refresh_token
    ConnApp->>Google: calendarList.list()
    Google-->>ConnApp: calendars + access roles
    ConnApp->>ConnApp: map roles to CalendarAccess
    ConnApp->>DB: save account (token encrypted)
    ConnApp->>DB: save calendars
    ConnApp-->>User: 201 {account_id, calendars}
